  "title": "wsutil+macOS: Add is_plugin_filename and disable some plugins",
  "description": "Add is_plugin_filename, which returns true if a filename ends with .dll\non Windows or .so on other platforms. Use it to check for valid filenames\nwhen loading Falco plugins.\n\nIn GitLab CI, disable a the Falco gcpaudit and k8saudit plugins by\nappending \".disabled\" to their respective filenames.\n\nNote in the release notes that this works around #20869",
