        {
          "id": 2957690466,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "With this MR applied I'm still seeing #20869.\n\n```\n% /Applications/Stratoshark.app/Contents/MacOS/strato --version\nruntime: g 17: unexpected return pc for runtime.cgocallback called from 0x106001921\n...\n```\n\n`falcodump` is reporting three plugins instead of one.\n\n```\n% /Applications/Stratoshark.app/Contents/MacOS/extcap/falcodump --extcap-interfaces                                                                                 \nextcap {version=1.0.0}{help=file:///Applications/Stratoshark.app/Contents/Resources/share/stratoshark/falcodump.html}\ninterface {value=cloudtrail}{display=Falco plugin}\ninterface {value=gcpaudit}{display=Falco plugin}\ninterface {value=k8saudit}{display=Falco plugin}\n```\n\nInstead of three files, we now have five files in the falco plugin folder!\n\n```\n% ls -la /Applications/Stratoshark.app/Contents/PlugIns/stratoshark/falco/* \n-rw-r--r--@ 1 jyoung  admin  22003184 Dec 16 07:50 /Applications/Stratoshark.app/Contents/PlugIns/stratoshark/falco/libcloudtrail.so\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 jyoung  admin  36572528 Dec 16 07:50 /Applications/Stratoshark.app/Contents/PlugIns/stratoshark/falco/libgcpaudit.so\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 jyoung  admin  36572496 Dec 16 07:50 /Applications/Stratoshark.app/Contents/PlugIns/stratoshark/falco/libgcpaudit.so.disabled\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 jyoung  admin  14433344 Dec 16 07:50 /Applications/Stratoshark.app/Contents/PlugIns/stratoshark/falco/libk8saudit.so\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 jyoung  admin  14433312 Dec 16 07:50 /Applications/Stratoshark.app/Contents/PlugIns/stratoshark/falco/libk8saudit.so.disabled\n```\n\nNote two copies of the gcpaudit and k8saudit plugins, each with and without the .disabled suffix.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6682068,
            "username": "jim.young",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Jim Young",
